Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.24,Kick,,0,0,0,,WORLD · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.24,Title,,0,0,0,,RUSSIA HITS\N3 KYIV BRIDGES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:33.24,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: Kyiv Independent · The National\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}84 MISSILES · 404 DRONES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:14.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Russia hit three bridges in the Ukrainian capital overnight, using eighty four cruise missiles and more than four hundred drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:19.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The three bridges are the Podilsko Voskresenskyi, the Southern, and the Darnytskyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:21.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}One reopened by about three in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:25.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}One was still being assessed, and one was partly restricted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:26.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Who is affected?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:28.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}People in Keev and other cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:33.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Water, power and heating were cut in places, and the mayor asked people not to drive.
